		{"id":"339710ba36e9244d","x":-300,"y":-300,"width":508,"height":260,"type":"text","text":"Wildfort is the continent that was transformed into Unhileg but in the current aera it is once again Wildfort as the Unhileg have seemingly been dealt with anyway more on that.\n\n\nWildforts arcanists:\n\nIn the continent of Wildfort there were many rising arcanists all brilliant in their own right and although they could not rival the knowledge and power of Armount they had their own accomplishments. "}
